 "accepted_results_headline": "Under the frozen rule (h on hash-table and solver operations only) the multi-target IC of this harness (the cheaper of ic5 and ic5ks) is dearer than the cheapest of 15 runs of its multi-target rho in all 27 (cell, I/M) decisions (I = 10 M: 1.04-1.16x at h = 0, 1.03-1.08x at h = 0.1, 1.20-1.76x at h = 1; 1.003-1.810x overall), and 1.14-1.49x a paired BSGS. Against either rho arm alone it is unranked in all 27. With rhodp's per-step canonicalisations priced at the same h, as AGENTS.md 5a requires, all 27 decisions are unranked (the IC is 0.89-0.94x the cheapest rho at h = 1, I = 10 M); with a non-degenerate retention for the IC (validator arm ic5rw) the IC is unranked against the frozen rhobest in all 27 and near parity at h = 0 and 0.1 against a better-tuned rho. No ranking against rho is established."
}